WEBVTT

NOTE
The ending and end credits — Rinoa revives Squall; the celebration and credits.
Duration: approximately 7 minutes 53 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A pale, empty whiteness.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.780
Rinoa finds Squall collapsed in the grey void and holds him.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:08.830
He revives in her arms; their reunion is complete.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:58.250
The scene gives way to celebration at Balamb Garden under the stars.

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:58.710
The cast laughs and celebrates their victory.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:26.400
The end credits roll beside Selphie's shaky camcorder footage of the cast.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.480
The home-video footage continues through the credits.
